  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership Fund: Africa Research and Innovation Commercialisation Summit (ARICS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This summit aims to: Orient the African research and innovation ecosystem towards a culture of value creation and market thinking; Empower researchers and innovators with practical tools, insights, and strategies to effectively navigate the research and innovation value chain; Bridge the gaps between research and market-ready products by advocating the enabling environment and critical support programmes required to eliminate barriers that impede researchers, innovators and industry: Create inclusive value chains that reach rural economies and marginalised groups, boosting equitable opportunities for all: Contribute to policy development, identifying challenges and solutions to create an enabling environment for research commercialisation: Demonstrate the impacts, success and outcomes of the Innovation Trust Corridor and the Innovation Market Value Chain Map; and galvanize stakeholders for UK-Ghana ST&amp;I Strategy success and unveil its potential value.</narrative>
  </description>
